  "comments": "The work contains numerous named references to other scholars.\r\nThe views of \"'ban\" ('ban dkon mchog rdo rje (ID:4243)) are frequently juxtaposed to those of \"mchims,\" for whom we follow the identification of mChims brTson 'grus seng ge (ID:4261) in [MGPRHX73].\r\nIn the same way, the author frequently juxtaposes the views of \"tho\" (tho kun dga' rdo rje (ID:3921)) and those of \"skyabs\"/\"byang chub skyabs\" (ID:3864).",
